{"data": [{"author_id": "343877206", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:37:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120299733482979545"], "id": "2120299733482979545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition Security scanning at that scale is a great use of strong models. The credits will help a lot of smaller teams.", "url": "https://x.com/smobilefactory/status/2120299733482979545"}, {"author_id": "2114261495278391296", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:37:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120269612097151362"], "id": "2120269612097151362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition Cognition 表示，Claude Mythos 5.2 现已可用于 Devin 托管的安全扫描，并将提供超过 1 亿美元的额度，适用资格标准和相关条件另行规定。", "url": "https://x.com/aixindongjing/status/2120269612097151362"}, {"author_id": "87078963", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:23:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120266085912002717"], "id": "2120266085912002717", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition Crédito pra achar vulnerabilidade é ótimo, mas achar nunca foi o gargalo: o difícil é alguém no time ter tempo de corrigir sem quebrar o resto. Se o Devin abre 200 alertas numa sexta, quem revisa? Ele já entrega o patch testado ou só a lista?", "url": "https://x.com/luisjuniorj/status/2120266085912002717"}, {"author_id": "180848844", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:08:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120262274250395898"], "id": "2120262274250395898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition giving companies credits to find and fix critical vulnerabilities is a strong way to get this into real security workflows", "url": "https://x.com/Bagdex/status/2120262274250395898"}, {"author_id": "1088455970420707328", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:51:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120258116290052398"], "id": "2120258116290052398", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition The 73.5 is an F2 score weighted toward recall, across 25 repos with 1,781 known vulnerabilities.", "url": "https://x.com/Cydr4l/status/2120258116290052398"}, {"author_id": "1724070962902028288", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:41:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120255527217254770"], "id": "2120255527217254770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition I'm building How‑Could‑I‑Be‑Hacked to give agents a hypothesis‑fit‑test loop that checks a scan like Mythos 5.2 locally before credits are spent, https://t.co/1wJGY83U3U", "url": "https://x.com/IronRedSandHive/status/2120255527217254770"}, {"author_id": "61479200", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:47:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120241888301326487"], "id": "2120241888301326487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cognition That’s a huge swing on the security front with the credits and the new model. Glad to see you guys moving so fast on the benchmarks.", "url": "https://x.com/InsomniaLK/status/2120241888301326487"}, {"author_id": "1652619593343549443", "conversation_id": "2120227474223292477", "created_at": "2026-1